		(descr "Infineon IM73A135 XENSIV analog MEMS microphone, PG-LLGA-5-3 bottom port. Local copy of the KiCad 10 Sensor_Audio:Infineon_PG-LLGA-5-2 land pattern with the ring-shaped pad 5 pulled 0.07 mm further out from the sound-port hole. The library version leaves 0.18 mm of copper-to-hole clearance, which fails the 0.25 mm hole clearance rule this board is built to. https://www.infineon.com/dgdl/Infineon-IM73A135-DataSheet-v01_00-EN.pdf?fileId=8ac78c8c7f2a768a017fadec36b84500")
